{"overview":"روایت دختر یک خانواده اعیان طهران قدیم با نام «محبوبه» است که عاشق شاگرد نجاری محله‌شان می‌شود. او خواستگارهایش را رد می‌کند و در برابر خانواده‌اش می‌ایستد تا آنها این عشق را به رسمیت بشناسند و به ازدواج او با رحیم رضایت دهند. غافل از اینکه چرخ گردون روزگار گاهی بر وفق مراد نمی‌چرخد..","tagline":"","overview_en":"The story is about a daughter of a noble family in old Tehran named \"Mahboobeh\" who falls in love with a carpenter's apprentice from their neighborhood. She rejects his suitors and stands up to her family so that they will recognize this love and consent to her marriage to Rahim. Unaware that the wheel of time sometimes does not turn according to the will.","tagline_en":"","runtime":60,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2025,"poster":"/20fOPlegCr8V9nj9ZmSiAYcugJ5.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":14,"y":2026,"poster":"/bWrqMUwqpzyinfH9yqMA29KsVay.jpg"}],"episodes":27,"crew":["نرگس آبیار"],"crew_en":["Narges Abyar"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"نوید پورفرج","role":"Rahim","photo":"/sAQiVx7nBaZsZWY0hIK2dQyScB0.jpg","en":"Navid Pourfaraj"},{"name":"ترلان پروانه","role":"Mahboubeh","photo":"/iZdljMYaGJpnCymYfptiVWLcrNc.jpg","en":"Tarlan Parvaneh"},{"name":"لاله اسکندری","role":"Nazanin Banoo","photo":"/q3UEl5tpL2H8QkcLQPqB22mwaAn.jpg","en":"Laleh Eskandari"},{"name":"پریوش نظریه","role":"Amme Keshvar","photo":"/cIw0UfNUoWQo9idMHRVjRufXLzd.jpg","en":"Parivash Nazarieh"},{"name":"رضا کیانیان","role":"Hesamol Molk","photo":"/5rkOWocXp5ZEp9jkoDzB3WgCola.jpg","en":"Reza Kianian"},{"name":"علی مصفا","role":"Basirol Molk","photo":"/kOf8LQQxDhybmTEIi4KNeLC4pOD.jpg","en":"Ali Mosaffa"},{"name":"لیندا کیانی","role":"Esmat","photo":"/c4C3aQGLSjkhH1WBaCIlwi0D9ur.jpg","en":"Linda Kiani"},{"name":"بهنوش بختیاری","role":"Dadeh","photo":"/lkjk0j2abeZaNzfZXJXoZmi2TEy.jpg","en":"Behnoush Bakhtiari"},{"name":"گلاره عباسی","role":"Nozhat","photo":"/986IPhEddd4EZRUVWLnfEl22x1M.jpg","en":"Gelare Abbasi"},{"name":"حمید صفت","